sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant P as Planner<br/>(language model)
    participant R as Retrieved content<br/>(untrusted data)
    participant G as Tool gateway<br/>(authorize, validate, limit)
    participant S as Domain service<br/>(deterministic API)
    participant H as Human approver

    U->>P: Goal
    P->>R: Fetch context
    R-->>P: Documents and tool results
    P->>G: Proposed tool call plus idempotency key
    G->>G: Policy, schema, budget
    alt high-risk action
        G->>H: Approval required
        H-->>G: Approved or denied
    end
    G->>S: Versioned, authorized execute
    S-->>G: Receipt
    G-->>P: Structured observation
    P-->>U: Response
